WEBVTT

1
00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:18.851
Day 1, August 5

2
00:00:18.852 --> 00:00:28.092
We moved into our cabins today.

3
00:00:28.093 --> 00:00:36.032
"I want the top bunk!"

4
00:00:36.033 --> 00:00:40.398
Day 2, August 6

5
00:00:40.399 --> 00:00:46.549
We went on a hike at half past eight.

6
00:00:46.550 --> 00:00:50.968
"Ouch! Mosquito bites!"

7
00:00:50.969 --> 00:00:58.025
We played volleyball at a quarter past two.

8
00:00:58.026 --> 00:01:06.092
"The blue team wins!"

9
00:01:06.093 --> 00:01:10.378
Day 3, August 7

10
00:01:10.379 --> 00:01:15.312
We rowed canoes at half past ten.

11
00:01:15.313 --> 00:01:22.088
"Let's race!"

12
00:01:22.089 --> 00:01:27.740
We made clay mugs at two.

13
00:01:27.741 --> 00:01:34.724
"Wow! Yours looks great!"

14
00:01:34.725 --> 00:01:38.445
Day 4, August 8

15
00:01:38.446 --> 00:01:45.780
We had a bonfire at a quarter to seven.

16
00:01:45.781 --> 00:01:49.026
"Who wants s'mores?"

17
00:01:49.027 --> 00:01:54.366
Bob told scary stories at half past eight.

18
00:01:54.367 --> 00:02:04.802
"The monster was very hairy . . ."

19
00:02:04.803 --> 00:02:09.302
Day 5, August 9

20
00:02:09.303 --> 00:02:19.818
Today was the last day of camp.

21
00:02:19.819 --> 00:02:31.258
"See you next year, Bob and Liz!"
